      "widgets_values": [
        "integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, a static wide side-view shot of a pure-white studio. A large grey office multifunction printer stands at the center, with its control panel on the right end and its paper output slot and tray on the plain left end. The tray is empty. A young woman with a wavy ash-brown bob walks a few steps in from the right. She wears an oversized cream and cobalt-blue striped chunky knit sweater, mustard-yellow cropped wide-leg trousers, and black lace-up boots. She opens the scanner lid and bends over the scanner. She presses her face straight down onto the glass, squashing her nose and cheeks. At the same moment, she presses her right hand flat onto the glass on the far side of her head, where her head hides it from the camera. She holds still while the scan light sweeps once beneath the glass. [Shot 2] At 00:04.500, the camera cuts to a top-down close-up of the output tray on the plain left end of the printer. A sheet of paper slides out of the slot. Printed on it is the black-and-white scan of what was pressed on the glass, seen from below: the same woman's face squashed flat with eyes closed, her chin-length wavy ash-brown bob spread flat around it, and beside her cheek her right hand making a peace sign, its palm and two spread fingers pressed flat. Everything around her face and hand is solid black. The paper comes to rest in the tray.\n\noverall_soundscape: Boot footsteps on a quiet studio floor, the creak of the scanner lid, and the hum of the scanner light moving under the glass, followed by the whir of the printer feeding the paper out.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: A light plucked bass line with muted finger snaps at a moderate tempo, stopping as the paper comes to rest."
      ],
